# GitNexus index store. Machine-local; the repo ships no index.
# `.gitnexusrc` sets skipContextFiles + skipSkills so `analyze` cannot inject an
# AGENTS.md/CLAUDE.md block claiming this repo is indexed -- false for anyone who
# clones it, and this collection's bar is that a public claim survives being pulled on.
.gitnexus/
